function smart_sort_array($set, $order) {
    usort($set, function ($a, $b) use ($order) {
        return $order === 'asc' ? strcmp($a['age'], $b['age']) : strcmp($b['age'], $a['age']);
    });
    return $set;
}
```

To use this function, simply call it with an array as the first argument and either 'asc' or 'desc' as the second argument like so:

```php
