2. Configure the DNS server:
   Create a new file named `named.conf.local` in the `/etc/bind/` directory. Add the following content to this file:

```
zone "your_domain.com" {
    type master;
    file "/etc/bind/db.your_domain.com";
};

zone "your_domain.com.in-addr.arpa" {
    type master;
    file "/etc/bind/db.your_domain.com.rev";
};
```

Replace `your_domain.com` with your actual domain name.

